# Sunset Saboteur has Ward -- Discard a card. Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (Swamp and Mox Jet). On turn 2 Bot2 Lightning Bolts
# it; the ward trigger asks Bot2 whether to discard, Bot2 declines, so the Bolt is countered and the Saboteur lives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Sunset Saboteur
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sunset Saboteur.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Sunset Saboteur)
Bot2.Decline

